The word is "(()(()))".
The last is the last position of word.
The stack is an empty list of whole numbers.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The symbol is character spot of word.
The size is the number of items in stack.
If symbol is "(", Place 0 into stack.
If symbol is ")".
The inner is item (size minus 1) of stack.
Remove the last item from stack.
The left is the number of items in stack.
The scored is 1.
If inner is more than 0, set scored to inner times 2.
If left is 0, Place scored into stack.
If left is more than 0, set item (left minus 1) of stack to item (left minus 1) of stack plus scored.

Show item 0 of stack.
